<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Plano de Estudo — C# → .NET → AWS → Automação → IA</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            background: #0f0f23;
            color: #e0e0e0;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 2rem;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2a4a;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #00d4aa;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        header p {
            color: #8888aa;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .stats {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .stat-card {
            background: #1a1a3e;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a5a;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            min-width: 140px;
        }

        .stat-card .number {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #00d4aa;
        }

        .stat-card .label {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #8888aa;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        .progress-bar-container {
            background: #1a1a3e;
            border-radius: 20px;
            height: 12px;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a5a;
        }

        .progress-bar {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #00d4aa, #00a8ff);
            border-radius: 20px;
            transition: width 0.5s ease;
        }

        .progress-label {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #8888aa;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
        }

        .phase {
            background: #1a1a3e;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a5a;
            border-radius: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .phase:hover {
            border-color: #00d4aa44;
        }

        .phase-header {
            padding: 1.2rem 1.5rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .phase-header:hover {
            background: #22224a;
        }

        .phase-title {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
        }

        .phase-icon {
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
        }

        .phase-0 .phase-icon { background: #2a2a1a; }
        .phase-1 .phase-icon { background: #1a3a2a; }
        .phase-2 .phase-icon { background: #1a2a3a; }
        .phase-3 .phase-icon { background: #1a3a3a; }
        .phase-4 .phase-icon { background: #2a1a3a; }
        .phase-5 .phase-icon { background: #2a3a1a; }
        .phase-6 .phase-icon { background: #3a2a1a; }
        .phase-7 .phase-icon { background: #3a1a1a; }

        .phase-info h2 {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .phase-info span {
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            color: #8888aa;
        }

        .phase-progress {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #00d4aa;
            font-weight: 600;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .phase-arrow {
            color: #8888aa;
            transition: transform 0.3s;
            margin-left: 1rem;
        }

        .phase.open .phase-arrow {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
        }

        .phase-content {
            display: none;
            padding: 0 1.5rem 1.5rem;
        }

        .phase.open .phase-content {
            display: block;
        }

        .week-group {
            margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
        }

        .week-group h3 {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #00a8ff;
            margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
            padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2a4a;
        }

        .task-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 0.75rem;
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: opacity 0.2s;
        }

        .task-item:hover {
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .task-item input[type="checkbox"] {
            display: none;
        }

        .checkmark {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
            border: 2px solid #4a4a6a;
            border-radius: 6px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .task-item input:checked + .checkmark {
            background: #00d4aa;
            border-color: #00d4aa;
        }

        .task-item input:checked + .checkmark::after {
            content: '✓';
            color: #0f0f23;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        .task-item input:checked ~ .task-label {
            text-decoration: line-through;
            color: #5a5a7a;
        }

        .task-label {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #ccccdd;
        }

        .project-card {
            background: #0f0f23;
            border: 1px dashed #00d4aa44;
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .project-card h4 {
            color: #00d4aa;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }

        .project-card p {
            color: #aaaacc;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .rules {
            background: #1a1a3e;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a5a;
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .rules h2 {
            color: #ffaa00;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .rules ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .rules li {
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
            color: #ccccdd;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            padding-left: 1.5rem;
            position: relative;
        }

        .rules li::before {
            content: '→';
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: #ffaa00;
        }

        .streak {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            padding: 1rem;
            background: #1a1a3e;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a5a;
        }

        .streak h3 {
            color: #ffaa00;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .streak .days {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ffaa00;
        }

        .streak .days-label {
            color: #8888aa;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        .streak-btn {
            margin-top: 0.8rem;
            padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
            background: #ffaa00;
            color: #0f0f23;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }

        .streak-btn:hover {
            background: #ffcc44;
            transform: scale(1.05);
        }

        .streak-btn:disabled {
            background: #4a4a6a;
            color: #8888aa;
            cursor: not-allowed;
            transform: none;
        }

        .reset-btn {
            display: block;
            margin: 2rem auto 0;
            padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
            background: transparent;
            color: #ff4444;
            border: 1px solid #ff444444;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        .reset-btn:hover {
            background: #ff444422;
        }

        .roadmap {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .roadmap-step {
            background: #1a1a3e;
            border: 1px solid #2a2a5a;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #8888aa;
        }

        .roadmap-arrow {
            color: #4a4a6a;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            body { padding: 1rem; }
            header h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
            .stats { flex-direction: column; align-items: center; }
            .roadmap { gap: 0.3rem; }
            .roadmap-step { font-size: 0.65rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>🎯 Dev Completo — da Base à Liderança Técnica</h1>
            <p>20 minutos por dia. Um passo de cada vez. Rumo à vaga dos sonhos.</p>
            <div class="roadmap">
                <span class="roadmap-step">Infra + Linux</span>
                <span class="roadmap-arrow">→</span>
                <span class="roadmap-step">C# Puro</span>
                <span class="roadmap-arrow">→</span>
                <span class="roadmap-step">.NET Core</span>
                <span class="roadmap-arrow">→</span>
                <span class="roadmap-step">.NET Avançado</span>
                <span class="roadmap-arrow">→</span>
                <span class="roadmap-step">AWS Cloud</span>
                <span class="roadmap-arrow">→</span>
                <span class="roadmap-step">Terraform + CI/CD</span>
                <span class="roadmap-arrow">→</span>
                <span class="roadmap-step">IA Aplicada</span>
                <span class="roadmap-arrow">→</span>
                <span class="roadmap-step">Agentes IA</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stats">
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="number" id="completed-count">0</div>
                    <div class="label">Concluídos</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="number" id="total-count">0</div>
                    <div class="label">Total</div>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-card">
                    <div class="number" id="percent-count">0%</div>
                    <div class="label">Progresso</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="streak">
            <h3>🔥 Sequência de Estudo</h3>
            <div class="days" id="streak-days">0</div>
            <div class="days-label">dias seguidos</div>
            <button class="streak-btn" id="streak-btn" onclick="markToday()">Estudei hoje ✓</button>
        </div>

        <div class="progress-bar-container">
            <div class="progress-bar" id="main-progress"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="progress-label" id="progress-label">0% completo</div>

        <!-- FASE 0 -->
        <div class="phase phase-0" data-phase="0">
            <div class="phase-header" onclick="togglePhase(this)">
                <div class="phase-title">
                    <div class="phase-icon">🟡</div>
                    <div class="phase-info">
                        <h2>Fase 0 — Fundamentos de Infraestrutura</h2>
                        <span>3–4 semanas · Linux, Redes, Active Directory, MongoDB</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;">
                    <span class="phase-progress" data-phase-progress="0">0/0</span>
                    <span class="phase-arrow">▼</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="phase-content">
                <div class="week-group">
                    <h3>Semana 1: Linux Essencial</h3>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-1"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Navegação: ls, cd, pwd, find, tree</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-2"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Arquivos: cat, less, grep, tail -f, vim básico</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-3"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Permissões: chmod, chown, grupos e usuários</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-4"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Processos: ps, top, htop, kill, systemctl</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-5"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Shell scripting básico (.sh, variáveis, loops, cron)</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-6"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">SSH — conectar, chaves pública/privada, scp</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-7"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Instalar e rodar .NET no Linux</span></label>
                </div>
                <div class="week-group">
                    <h3>Semana 2: Redes de Computadores</h3>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-8"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Modelo OSI e TCP/IP — camadas e protocolos</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-9"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">IP, máscara de sub-rede, gateway, CIDR</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-10"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">DNS — como funciona, resolução de nomes</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-11"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">HTTP/HTTPS — request, response, status codes, headers</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-12"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Firewall, portas, VPN — conceitos práticos</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-13"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Ferramentas: ping, traceroute, netstat, curl, nslookup</span></label>
                </div>
                <div class="week-group">
                    <h3>Semana 3: Active Directory</h3>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-14"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">O que é AD — domínios, forest, árvore, OUs</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-15"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Usuários, grupos e políticas (GPO)</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-16"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">LDAP — protocolo, queries, atributos</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-17"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Autenticação com AD no .NET (LDAP + DirectoryServices)</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-18"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Azure AD / Entra ID — SSO e integração moderna</span></label>
                </div>
                <div class="week-group">
                    <h3>Semana 4: MongoDB</h3>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-19"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">NoSQL vs SQL — quando usar cada um</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-20"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Documentos, coleções, BSON</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-21"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">CRUD com MongoDB Shell e Compass</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-22"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Filtros, projeções, sort, limit, skip</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-23"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Índices e performance</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-24"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">MongoDB Driver para .NET — CRUD na API</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="0-25"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Aggregation Pipeline — $match, $group, $project</span></label>
                </div>
                <div class="project-card">
                    <h4>🛠 Projeto da Fase</h4>
                    <p>API de catálogo de produtos usando MongoDB + ASP.NET Core rodando no Linux via Docker. Login integrado com LDAP (AD simulado com OpenLDAP).</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FASE 1 -->
        <div class="phase phase-1 open" data-phase="1">
            <div class="phase-header" onclick="togglePhase(this)">
                <div class="phase-title">
                    <div class="phase-icon">🟢</div>
                    <div class="phase-info">
                        <h2>Fase 1 — Fundamentos de C#</h2>
                        <span>3–4 semanas · C# puro, sem framework</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;">
                    <span class="phase-progress" data-phase-progress="1">0/0</span>
                    <span class="phase-arrow">▼</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="phase-content">
                <div class="week-group">
                    <h3>Semana 1–2: Básico</h3>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-1"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Variáveis, tipos e conversões</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-2"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Condicionais (if, switch, pattern matching)</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-3"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Loops (for, foreach, while)</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-4"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Métodos (parâmetros, retorno, sobrecarga)</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-5"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Arrays e strings</span></label>
                </div>
                <div class="week-group">
                    <h3>Semana 3–4: Orientação a Objetos</h3>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-6"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Classes, objetos e construtores</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-7"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Propriedades e encapsulamento</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-8"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Herança e polimorfismo</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-9"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Interfaces e classes abstratas</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-10"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Generics (List&lt;T&gt;, Dictionary&lt;K,V&gt;)</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-11"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">LINQ — consultas, filtros, projeções</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-12"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Tratamento de exceções (try/catch/finally)</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="1-13"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Async/Await — programação assíncrona</span></label>
                </div>
                <div class="project-card">
                    <h4>🛠 Projeto da Fase</h4>
                    <p>Sistema de gerenciamento de tarefas no console — CRUD em memória com classes, listas, LINQ e async file I/O.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- FASE 2 -->
        <div class="phase phase-2" data-phase="2">
            <div class="phase-header" onclick="togglePhase(this)">
                <div class="phase-title">
                    <div class="phase-icon">🔵</div>
                    <div class="phase-info">
                        <h2>Fase 2 — ASP.NET Core + Banco de Dados</h2>
                        <span>5–6 semanas · API REST + EF Core + Auth</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;">
                    <span class="phase-progress" data-phase-progress="2">0/0</span>
                    <span class="phase-arrow">▼</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="phase-content">
                <div class="week-group">
                    <h3>Semana 5–6: API REST Básica</h3>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-1"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Criar projeto com dotnet new webapi</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-2"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Controllers, rotas e verbos HTTP (GET, POST, PUT, DELETE)</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-3"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Models, DTOs e AutoMapper</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-4"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Injeção de dependência e Service Layer</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-5"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Middleware e tratamento global de erros</span></label>
                </div>
                <div class="week-group">
                    <h3>Semana 7–8: Entity Framework Core</h3>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-6"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Setup do EF Core + DbContext</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-7"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Migrations — criar, aplicar, reverter</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-8"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Relacionamentos (1:N, N:N)</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-9"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Queries com LINQ + EF (Include, Where, Select)</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-10"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Validações com FluentValidation ou DataAnnotations</span></label>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-11"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">Repository Pattern + Unit of Work</span></label>
                </div>
                <div class="week-group">
                    <h3>Semana 9–10: Autenticação e Segurança</h3>
                    <label class="task-item"><input type="checkbox" data-task="2-12"><span class="checkmark"></span><span class="task-label">JWT — geração, validação e refresh tokens</span></label>
